WEBVTT

01:29.380 --> 01:33.130
[Cage of Shadows]

01:33.520 --> 01:36.190
[Episode 21]

01:36.830 --> 01:40.330
[Virtue and Merit in Equal Splendor]

01:45.259 --> 01:47.240
My mother was born a noblewoman.

01:47.500 --> 01:49.990
But she ended up a prisoner
in Lingya Tower.

01:51.350 --> 01:53.610
Then that bastard Meng Shuo defiled her.

01:54.479 --> 01:56.720
That was how she had me.

01:57.000 --> 01:59.759
The other women in prison looked after us.

02:00.040 --> 02:03.240
They taught me to read and fight.

02:04.000 --> 02:07.260
But I could only watch them
participate in the death match,

02:07.400 --> 02:08.479
dying one by one,

02:08.479 --> 02:09.639
and I was powerless to help.

02:09.639 --> 02:10.560
Master.

02:12.160 --> 02:13.600
It's all in the past now.

02:14.040 --> 02:15.840
Let's not talk about it tonight.

02:16.520 --> 02:17.320
Here.

02:22.710 --> 02:23.510
Okay.

02:24.520 --> 02:25.200
Cheers.

02:31.600 --> 02:33.040
Long trapped in a cage,

02:34.079 --> 02:35.480
now free in nature again.

02:35.640 --> 02:37.300
If Lingya Tower didn't exist,

02:38.500 --> 02:41.700
I'd really want to stay here
with you forever.

02:48.000 --> 02:50.079
Then tonight, let's pretend

02:50.680 --> 02:52.079
none of it exists.

02:54.400 --> 02:55.570
No tower.

02:56.520 --> 02:57.560
No cage.

02:59.480 --> 03:00.950
Just wine.

03:02.560 --> 03:03.640
Just rabbit.

03:06.240 --> 03:07.700
Just master and disciple.

03:09.680 --> 03:11.490
Then eat up.

03:11.880 --> 03:13.240
Maybe this meal

03:13.680 --> 03:15.720
is the last peace we'll get.

03:19.010 --> 03:19.579
Here.

03:24.850 --> 03:25.650
Yummy.

03:26.700 --> 03:27.320
Yummy.

03:27.400 --> 03:28.360
It's so yummy.

03:29.030 --> 03:29.829
Master.

03:30.440 --> 03:31.710
If you hadn't learned martial arts,

03:31.710 --> 03:33.040
you could've been a cook

03:33.040 --> 03:34.320
and fed me for life.

03:36.320 --> 03:37.600
Slow down.

03:37.640 --> 03:38.560
Don't choke.

03:38.880 --> 03:39.880
Look at you.

03:40.520 --> 03:41.320
Master.

03:41.840 --> 03:44.200
Do you remember
when you first came to our home

03:44.200 --> 03:45.840
and had your first meal?

03:48.520 --> 03:49.800
It's been so long.

03:50.030 --> 03:51.040
You still remember?

03:51.040 --> 03:52.320
How could I forget?

03:52.880 --> 03:54.490
You were badly wounded.

03:55.040 --> 03:56.700
We cared for you for so long.

03:56.810 --> 03:59.010
We nearly thought you'd never wake up.

03:59.840 --> 04:01.400
But after you woke up,

04:01.520 --> 04:02.780
the first thing you did

04:02.840 --> 04:04.440
was ask for meat.

04:08.400 --> 04:10.960
Back then I risked my life
escaping the tower.

04:14.120 --> 04:16.320
It was the first time I'd seen the world.

04:20.200 --> 04:21.880
Thankfully I met you all.

04:27.920 --> 04:28.930
Rabbit.

04:43.430 --> 04:44.630
You...

05:14.730 --> 05:17.330
My mother made this rabbit
specially for you.

05:20.000 --> 05:21.530
Can I become your disciple?

05:23.200 --> 05:24.740
I like rabbit too.

05:24.880 --> 05:26.680
Can you teach me how to catch one?

05:31.820 --> 05:34.080
Look, my braiding isn't that bad, right?

05:35.960 --> 05:39.310
Master, when will you start teaching me?

05:39.530 --> 05:41.860
When did I agree to
take you as my disciple?

05:42.530 --> 05:44.680
Since I combed your hair for you,

05:44.760 --> 05:46.490
please think about it, Master.

05:47.040 --> 05:48.460
I've never taken a disciple.

05:48.460 --> 05:49.290
I don't know how to teach.

05:49.290 --> 05:51.460
I've never had a master either.

05:51.900 --> 05:53.560
We can look out for each other.

05:55.450 --> 05:56.580
I'll think about it.

05:57.900 --> 05:59.630
I'll take that as a yes.

06:00.040 --> 06:01.520
Let's pinky swear.

06:01.520 --> 06:02.560
No backing out.

06:02.800 --> 06:04.120
Do you know

06:04.360 --> 06:05.520
how much pain

06:05.910 --> 06:07.550
it takes to gain such skills?

06:29.040 --> 06:29.920
Master.

06:33.040 --> 06:36.320
Master, teach me your best martial arts.

06:36.340 --> 06:38.450
I want to avenge my parents.

07:59.680 --> 08:00.880
Things have been hard

08:01.800 --> 08:02.960
for you lately.

08:03.890 --> 08:04.690
Not at all.

08:06.880 --> 08:08.540
If it weren't for you, Master,

08:08.760 --> 08:11.720
I don't know how I would've kept going.

08:19.080 --> 08:20.640
I made this for you, Master.

08:20.640 --> 08:23.410
I call it filigree bangle.

08:24.480 --> 08:26.600
Someday, when you wear it,

08:26.640 --> 08:28.500
we'll storm Lingya Tower together.

08:28.500 --> 08:29.680
We'll be unstoppable

08:29.680 --> 08:31.480
and nothing can stand in our way.

08:37.360 --> 08:39.090
Lingya Tower is full of danger.

08:39.280 --> 08:41.559
I can't let you risk your life with me.

08:41.559 --> 08:44.420
How could I just watch you
go in alone, risk your life

08:44.420 --> 08:45.590
and do nothing?

08:46.000 --> 08:47.320
Then you'll have to.

08:49.240 --> 08:50.240
I have my own plan.

08:50.880 --> 08:52.960
Master.

08:52.980 --> 08:54.180
You said it yourself.

08:54.200 --> 08:56.530
Lingya Tower is extremely dangerous.

08:56.760 --> 08:59.460
One more person means better odds.

09:00.600 --> 09:03.880
Besides, if a sinful place
like Lingya Tower

09:04.640 --> 09:05.900
isn't destroyed soon,

09:05.930 --> 09:08.370
more women will fall into it,

09:08.400 --> 09:10.640
becoming playthings
for the rich and powerful,

09:10.640 --> 09:12.570
and living a life worse than death.

09:13.800 --> 09:15.950
Master. Master.

09:16.560 --> 09:18.200
Just admit it this once.

09:19.720 --> 09:21.440
Admit that you need me.

09:22.250 --> 09:23.250
Please.

09:30.000 --> 09:30.840
Fine.

09:31.970 --> 09:32.930
But

09:33.940 --> 09:35.270
you have to listen to me.

09:40.800 --> 09:41.600
Yanzhi.

09:43.190 --> 09:45.170
Actually, you don't have to do this.

09:45.170 --> 09:46.010
Burn it.

09:47.480 --> 09:48.880
Burn this place to ashes.

09:49.500 --> 09:51.360
Then there'll be no turning back.

09:51.760 --> 09:53.400
I know you're set on revenge.

09:54.040 --> 09:55.700
But your mother is already...

09:56.240 --> 09:57.400
If anything happens to you...

09:57.400 --> 09:57.850
I...

09:57.880 --> 09:58.680
Master.

09:59.520 --> 10:00.640
In this world,

10:02.760 --> 10:04.040
other than you,

10:05.940 --> 10:07.740
I have nothing left to hold on to.

10:12.950 --> 10:14.550
[Virtue and Merit in Equal Splendor]

10:22.700 --> 10:23.460
Yanzhi.

10:23.660 --> 10:24.560
Going to Lingya Tower

10:24.560 --> 10:25.880
will definitely be dangerous.

10:25.880 --> 10:28.080
You will enter with me
disguised as a mute servant.

10:28.080 --> 10:29.480
We'll split up,

10:29.480 --> 10:31.340
so I may not be able to protect you.

10:31.380 --> 10:32.780
Be careful at every step.

10:33.660 --> 10:35.180
Don't worry, Master.

10:36.070 --> 10:37.710
I can take care of myself.

10:45.800 --> 10:46.640
Hyah!

10:47.770 --> 10:48.220
Hyah!

10:48.250 --> 10:48.730
Hyah!

11:08.880 --> 11:09.680
Wujiu.

11:15.960 --> 11:17.320
It's late.

11:17.400 --> 11:18.920
What are you still doing here?

11:18.920 --> 11:20.140
Tower Master.

11:20.400 --> 11:22.210
The Lantern Festival is coming up.

11:22.210 --> 11:24.230
I was ordered to
select the female prisoners,

11:24.230 --> 11:25.490
so I dare not slack off.

11:26.980 --> 11:27.730
Tower Master.

11:27.730 --> 11:28.930
Hei Ya asks to see you.

11:31.000 --> 11:32.450
Be thorough.

11:32.590 --> 11:34.010
No mistakes.

11:34.170 --> 11:35.360
Yes, Tower Master.

11:44.030 --> 11:45.290
I'll go keep an eye on Hei Ya.

11:45.290 --> 11:46.010
You stay here

11:46.010 --> 11:46.850
and continue the operation.

11:46.850 --> 11:47.330
Yes.

11:47.800 --> 11:48.930
Be careful, Master.

11:58.620 --> 11:59.620
Stop right there!

12:17.630 --> 12:18.990
You got out.

12:19.160 --> 12:20.600
Why come back?

12:34.680 --> 12:36.740
Getting the antidote wasn't enough?

12:36.760 --> 12:38.560
You came back to kill Hei Ya.

12:39.290 --> 12:41.800
How bold of you.

12:42.350 --> 12:43.310
You knew?

12:43.400 --> 12:45.040
Did you really think

12:45.700 --> 12:48.420
that your plans with Zhuang Wujiu

12:48.720 --> 12:50.520
could fool everyone?

12:52.110 --> 12:55.810
If the Tower Master
and I hadn't shown mercy,

12:56.330 --> 12:58.860
you never would've reached
the fourth floor.

12:59.890 --> 13:01.940
Don't act like you're so righteous,

13:02.120 --> 13:04.600
as if that could wash away your sins.

13:05.030 --> 13:06.110
Enough talk.

13:06.320 --> 13:07.160
Come on.

13:34.690 --> 13:35.490
Qi.

13:36.520 --> 13:37.840
Nan Yanzhi.

13:38.800 --> 13:39.960
You're alive.

13:41.130 --> 13:42.450
Thank goodness.

13:45.430 --> 13:46.790
I missed you so much.

13:49.060 --> 13:50.420
Qi, you can talk?

14:00.840 --> 14:01.520
My lord.

14:01.520 --> 14:04.720
The girls serving you tonight
have all entered the tower.

14:09.230 --> 14:10.800
Looks like the real show

14:10.830 --> 14:12.590
is about to begin.

15:45.080 --> 15:45.980
Zhuang Wujiu.

15:46.010 --> 15:49.360
How do you like the show
I arranged for you?
